 lost hunting in the forest here. Hungry and tired, he met an old woman.","She had nothing but a pot of boiled beans - benda kaalu - and she gave him all of it.","He named the place Benda-Kaalu-Ooru. Bengaluru."],"speaker":"Bean Ajji"},{"say":"...Oh! One of the beans in the pot is glowing!"},{"battle":{"wild":{"species":150,"level":50},"music":"MUSIC_LEGEND","environment":"city"},"onWin":[{"setFlag":"BENDA_DONE"},{"if":{"caught":150},"then":[{"say":"The little bean that named a city is travelling with you now."}],"else":[{"say":"The glowing bean hops back into the pot and goes quiet. Some stories stay where they began."}]}],"onLose":[]}],"else":[{"say":["Groundnuts! Hot boiled beans! Best at the fair, kanda.","My grandmother's grandmother sold beans on this very street. Come back when you've seen more of the land - I'll tell you a story."],"speaker":"Bean Ajji"}]}]}]},{"id":"metro_bg","x":27,"y":34,"sprite":"metro_staff","facing":"DOWN","movement":"IDLE","script":[{"say":"Welcome to Namma Metro, National College station.","speaker":"Metro Staff"},{"if":{"hasItem":"Metro Card"},"then":[{"metro":true}],"else":[{"say":"Sorry, you need a Metro Card to ride. They're given out by the city office... for good citizens.","speaker":"Metro Staff"}]}]},{"id":"bannerghatta_guard","x":34,"y":35,"sprite":"park_ranger","facing":"UP","movement":"IDLE","hideIf":"GOT_STARTER","script":[{"say":["Forest checkpost! Bannerghatta is wild country - elephants, leopards, and Urumon that bite.","No partner Urumon, no entry. Come back when Professor Sharada has trusted you with one."],"speaker":"Forest Guard"}]},{"id":"ramanagara_boi","x":3,"y":14,"sprite":"area_boi","facing":"RIGHT","movement":"IDLE","hideIf":"CHAMPION_DONE","script":[{"say":["Mysuru Road is closed, boss. The rocks out at Ramanagara are full of very old, very angry Urumon.","Only the Champion of the Namma Council goes past this barricade. Rules of the area."],"speaker":"Area Boi"}]},{"id":"priest_bt","x":34,"y":21,"sprite":"man4","facing":"DOWN","movement":"IDLE","script":[{"say":["Long ago a bull kept eating the farmers' groundnuts. They prayed, and it turned to stone right here.","Then the stone bull kept GROWING. So they hammered an iron peg into its head. True story. Mostly."]}]},{"id":"tea_anna","x":16,"y":9,"sprite":"vendor","facing":"DOWN","movement":"IDLE","script":[{"say":["One by two kaapi? Strong, extra sugar, served in a steel tumbler and davara.","Pour it high so it gets frothy. If you don't spill some, you're not doing it right."]}]},{"id":"techie_bt","x":27,"y":9,"sprite":"techie_m","facing":"DOWN","movement":"WANDER","wanderRadius":1,"script":[{"say":"I work from home, which is also my office, which is also my mother's living room. Very agile."}]},{"id":"kid2_bt","x":19,"y":33,"sprite":"kid2","facing":"RIGHT","movement":"IDLE","script":[{"say":"Gully cricket rules: hit the neighbour's window and you're out. AND you pay. AND you run."}]},{"id":"tower_ajja","x":7,"y":33,"sprite":"ajja","facing":"UP","movement":"IDLE","script":[{"say":["From up here, the old-timers say you could hear the bugle from the watchtower all the way to the fort.","That's why it's called Bugle Rock. Now you hear mostly auto horns."]}]},{"id":"auto_bt","x":35,"y":28,"sprite":"auto_driver","facing":"RIGHT","movement":"IDLE","script":[{"say":"Meter? Meter is for tourists, saar. For you, special rate: one and a half. Swalpa adjust maadi."}]},{"id":"flower_akka","x":6,"y":29,"sprite":"woman4","facing":"LEFT","movement":"IDLE","script":[{"say":"Mallige, kanakambara, sevanthige! Fresh this morning from the market. One mola for your hair?"}]}],"signs":[{"x":23,"y":4,"text":"BASAVANAGUDI - Where the Big Bull keeps watch."},{"x":4,"y":30,"text":"BUGLE ROCK PARK. Please do not climb the rocks. (Urumon are allowed.) Use the steps - they're older than your grandfather's grandfather."},{"x":13,"y":19,"text":"Prof. Sharada's URUMON LAB - Visitors welcome. Mind the experiments."},{"x":23,"y":21,"text":"DODDA BASAVANA GUDI - the Big Bull Temple. Groundnut fair every November!"},{"x":4,"y":11,"text":"WEST: MYSURU ROAD. Ramanagara Rocks, 50 km. (Road closed for 'repairs'. Since forever.)"},{"x":32,"y":36,"style":"forest","text":"SOUTH: BANNERGHATTA FOREST. Forest Department checkpost. Elephants have right of way."},{"x":25,"y":35,"style":"metro","text":"NAMMA METRO - National College station. Mind the gap. Mind the auto drivers too."},{"x":12,"y":33,"style":"stone","text":"KEMPEGOWDA'S TOWER. The founder of Bengaluru built four towers in 1537 to mark how far his city should ever grow. The city did not listen."}],"items":[{"id":"kaapi1","x":11,"y":31,"item":"Filter Kaapi"}],"triggers":[{"id":"no_starter","x":20,"y":2,"w":2,"h":1,"once":false,"unless":"GOT_STARTER","script":[{"exclaim":"guard_n"},{"say":["Hey, wait! It's dangerous to go out without an Urumon!","Professor Sharada's lab is just down the road, past the cross street."]},{"playerWalk":["DOWN"]}]}],"counters":[],"interactables":[{"x":4,"y":25,"script":[{"say":"FLOWERS. Jasmine, roses and marigolds by the kilo. The florist weaves garlands faster than you can blink."}]},{"x":8,"y":25,"script":[{"say":"SILKS. A wall of silk sarees in every colour. Somebody's aunty is bargaining at championship level."}]},{"x":12,"y":25,"script":[{"say":"BAKERY. Fresh benne biscuits and honey cake! The baker waves you off: 'Urumon don't pay in rupees, no?'"}]},{"x":16,"y":25,"script":[{"say":"DOSA CAMP. The queue goes out the door. A sign says: 'No parcel. Dosa must be eaten hot.'"}]},{"x":15,"y":5,"script":[{"say":"A note on the door: 'Gone to Mysuru for a wedding. Please water the tulasi. - Shastri'"}]}],"encounters":{"grass":{"rate":0.12,"slots":[{"species":72,"min":3,"max":5,"weight":30},{"species":13,"min":3,"max":5,"weight":20},{"species":76,"min":3,"max":5,"weight":20},{"species":66,"min":3,"max":5,"weight":15},{"species":120,"min":4,"max":5,"weight":10},{"species":83,"min":5,"max":5,"weight":5}]}},"water":[],"lights":[{"x":13,"y":7,"size":2.4,"tint":16765072},{"x":16,"y":7,"size":2.4,"tint":16760944},{"x":23,"y":2,"size":3.2,"tint":16767120},{"x":13,"y":10,"size":3.2,"tint":16767120},{"x":12,"y":17,"size":2.8,"tint":16769184},{"x":29,"y":19,"size":2.2,"tint":16765056},{"x":37,"y":19,"size":2.2,"tint":16765056}],"onEnter":null,"spawn":null,"metroStation":"basavanagudi","respawnText":null}}